     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">In have have genotyped one sample two to three times and I want to know within sample difference by what means I run this?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>-- </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:blue\">Thank you!</span></b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:blue\">Kind regards,</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:#f3f3f3;background:#9900ff\">Kndalem Yaregal </span></i></b><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"59\" style=\"width:1.2083in;min-height:.6145in\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/dartr/attach/b10267fa7a475/image001.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:red;background:white\">MSc.</span></i></b><b><i><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:blue\">\r\n Student in Plant Breeding and Genetics |</span></i></b><b><i><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:#38761d\">Wollo</span></i></b><b><span style=\"color:#38761d\"> University</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:24.0pt;color:#38761d\"> </span></b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:blue\">Plant Breeder |</span></i></b><b><i><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:lime\">Sekota Dryland Agricultural Research Center</span></i></b><b><i><span